msgctxt "132\t275"
msgid "Y'know, I'd always thought\\nthey'd end up together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "279\t336"
msgid "Seems it wasn't meant to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "338\t447"
msgid "Sayama-kun is an ambitious girl, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "477\t540"
msgid "You can say that again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "703\t755"
msgid "Outta gas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "758\t785"
msgid "Here."
msgstr "Ecco."

msgctxt "788\t848"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "Grazie."

msgctxt "1023\t1079"
msgid "You can hang on to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1082\t1133"
msgid "Think of it as a gift."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1173\t1229"
msgid "No smoking in Division 1, anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232\t1289"
msgid "Division 1?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1292\t1395"
msgid "Yes. I'll be transferring,\\neffective next month."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1406\t1590"
msgid ""
"And unlike 4, Division 1 has a reputation to uphold.\\nCan't be seen smoking"
" on the job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1598\t1693"
msgid "Look at you getting promoted!\\nCongrats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1696\t1802"
msgid "I'm not sure it's cause for celebration."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1849\t1947"
msgid "Think back to the feud between\\nthe Tojo Clan and Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1980\t2139"
msgid ""
"In the end, neither the Metropolitan nor the\\nPrefectural Police did a damn"
" thing to stop it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2145\t2322"
msgid "And given Division Chief Kurahashi's\\ninvolvement with the Jingweon..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2341\t2456"
msgid "The force's reputation has hit rock bottom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2466\t2555"
msgid "Then why're you going back to Div 1?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2562\t2621"
msgid "It's essentially a bribe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2644\t2836"
msgid ""
"Everyone involved has been promoted,\\nincluding both myself and Sayama-kun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2848\t3018"
msgid ""
"I suppose they think keeping us happy\\nwill also keep us quiet about what "
"happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3022\t3088"
msgid "Eh, a promotion's a promotion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3090\t3193"
msgid "Doesn't matter how you got it;\\nyou're an elite again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3200\t3264"
msgid "I suppose, yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3288\t3346"
msgid "You don't sound too pleased."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3385\t3445"
msgid "That's because I'm worried."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3467\t3522"
msgid "About what?"
msgstr "Di cosa?"

msgctxt "3524\t3603"
msgid "What happens to Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3622\t3754"
msgid ""
"The police are planning to back off both\\nthe Tojo and the Omi for the time"
" being."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3756\t3833"
msgid "Remove themselves from yakuza matters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3842\t3996"
msgid "It's only right after what\\nthey did to spare our blushes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4016\t4070"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "Giusta osservazione."

msgctxt "4079\t4178"
msgid "So? What's worrying you, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4192\t4294"
msgid "I still don't trust the yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4313\t4416"
msgid "If Kiryu-san won't be leading the Tojo Clan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4428\t4556"
msgid "I fear Kamurocho will simply\\nfall back into the muck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4564\t4610"
msgid "You can rest easy, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4683\t4773"
msgid "Guy like him always has a plan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4782\t4856"
msgid "After all he did, he's not gonna\\njust let things go to shit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4858\t4979"
msgid "And you can take that to the bank."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5070\t5140"
msgid "Well, we should probably get going."
msgstr "Beh, meglio che vada."

msgctxt "5145\t5185"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

msgctxt "5187\t5255"
msgid "Off to Kamurocho, I assume?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5258\t5299"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "5302\t5424"
msgid "Kazuki and Yuya deserve a goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5431\t5461"
msgid "And..."
msgstr "E poi..."

msgctxt "5463\t5506"
msgid "And what?"
msgstr "E poi cosa?"

msgctxt "5514\t5661"
msgid "There's someone else I need\\nto talk to before I leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5663\t5719"
msgid "About the Tojo Clan, I'm sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5721\t5752"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr "Già."

msgctxt "5754\t5886"
msgid "At this rate, Daigo'll end up\\nthe Tojo Clan's sixth chairman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5897\t5997"
msgid "But he's still young."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5999\t6086"
msgid "I'm not sure he has\\nthe strength to lead just yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6088\t6166"
msgid "So you'll need someone to support him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6168\t6222"
msgid "Did you have anyone in mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6224\t6424"
msgid ""
"There's a guy who's been working\\nwith the Tojo just as long as I have, "
"yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6445\t6490"
msgid "I know just who you mean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6493\t6636"
msgid "But do you really think Daigo\\nhas what it takes to tame him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6638\t6787"
msgid "Nobody does.\\nYou and I both know that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6789\t6842"
msgid "Goro Majima..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6845\t6971"
msgid "I wonder if he'd even find the Tojo\\nappealing in its current state."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6974\t7033"
msgid "I'm sure you're thinking the same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7036\t7091"
msgid "You've got that right."
msgstr "Hai proprio ragione."

msgctxt "7111\t7230"
msgid "Do you think you can convince him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7239\t7295"
msgid "Don't have much choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7298\t7420"
msgid "That's why I'm going to see him today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7422\t7503"
msgid "I have to persuade him\\none way or another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7639\t7716"
msgid "Hopefully that \"persuasion\"\\ndoesn't involve your fists."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7718\t7854"
msgid "Eh. I guess we'll find out soon enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7994\t8047"
msgid "Stay safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8056\t8146"
msgid "Same to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8189\t8264"
msgid "Well, it's time we get going."
msgstr ""
